#: ../../source/docs/connect-autopilot.rst:5 619963ada24242a6b030ecd44e4de926
msgid "Connect Autopilot to APM Planner 2"
msgstr "将飞控连接至 APM Planner 2"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-autopilot.rst:7 4f3e1ff7b24b483a900b36d5d084acfd
msgid ""
"For setup, to load a mission, and to view data, follow these instruction to "
"connect your autopilot to APM Planner."
msgstr "如需进行设置、加载任务以及查看数据，请按以下说明将飞控连接至 APM Planner。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-autopilot.rst:11 fc6e7529641c49de8d65702e3538d2cd
msgid "1 Connect autopilot"
msgstr "1 连接飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-autopilot.rst:13 9fec4c2cbef1493287f1499d46a2470c
msgid ""
"Connect the autopilot to your computer using a USB cable or a 3DR Radio. A "
"3DR Radio allows you to communicate with your vehicle in flight and provides"
" more mobility during calibration."
msgstr "使用 USB 数据线或 3DR 数传将飞控连接至计算机。3DR 数传允许您在飞行中与飞行器通信，并在校准过程中提供更大的移动自由度。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-autopilot.rst:20 591e2ec4481d4daba27342a6da68b514
msgid "USB Connection to APM Autopilot"
msgstr "APM 飞控的 USB 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-autopilot.rst:25 d297ede6e94841c087dc1ccf955b05f5
msgid "Laptop Connection via TelemetryRadio"
msgstr "通过数传电台连接笔记本电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-autopilot.rst:28 7fc0857d895b412f8ddd9a132350a8f9
msgid "2 Connect to MavLink"
msgstr "2 连接至 MAVLink"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-autopilot.rst:30 3947f79ffb8544f995cb1a52dd464f03
msgid "Select the **connect box** to select a port."
msgstr "选择「connect box」以选择端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-autopilot.rst:35 e19ce559239d4a8387ffe9c039abb574
msgid ""
"Set the rate to **115200** for USB and **57600** for a 3DR Radio. Select "
"**Connect**."
msgstr "USB 连接将波特率设为 **115200**，3DR 数传连接设为 **57600**。选择「Connect」。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-autopilot.rst:41 03a9524fc5fe42d4a55b223f619c7139
msgid ""
"When connected, AP2 will display the green connected icon as shown below."
msgstr "连接成功后，AP2 将显示绿色的已连接图标，如下所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-autopilot.rst:48 9b8f68fb30984fc5a78007dd891de7db
msgid "3 Disconnect when installing firmware"
msgstr "3 安装固件时请先断开连接"

#: ../../source/docs/connect-autopilot.rst:50 0c9fe6b599e44619a0b3ebc24b43dc7c
msgid ""
"The autopilot must be unconnected to MAVLink (showing the red disconnected "
"icon) to install firmware. Otherwise you will receive the warning shown "
"above."
msgstr "安装固件时，飞控必须与 MAVLink 断开连接（显示红色的未连接图标）。否则将收到上述警告。"
